   "divisionVintage": "TIGER_GENZ2025",
   "statement": "No statewide ballot question is on the November 3, 2026 ballot. The Secretary of State's 2026 Election Details page (read August 17, 2026, in a browser — the host refuses automated clients) lists no constitutional amendment question, and no voters' guide for one exists the way 2024's did.",
   "provenance": {
